{"version":1,"content":"<p>受三季報AI資本開支超預期、短期利潤承壓影響，騰訊控股（00700.HK）今日股價下挫並創2024年8月以來新低。截至發稿跌6.12%，報350港元。這也影響了其他科網股巨頭甚至指數，阿里巴巴-W(09988.HK)和快手-W(01024.HK)跌5%，美團-W(03690.HK)跌3%，恒生科技指數跌約2.5%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587080.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.887389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:20:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"b39984e77f94d31fbc8dec7438bd61fca3acd7acb7c235b9fa37bb2082c63815","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}